{"id":"vod_bf_11454","vodId":"11454","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第一季","name_cn":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-12/e6a765f153914016352702b78404e441.jpg"},"summary":"佐村薰炭（田村由香里 配音）是一位平凡的公司职员，每日过着朝九晚五的规律生活，日子平静又安宁。可是，这样一个普通的女人，他的老公十一（铃村健一 配音）却是个彻头彻尾的“宅男”。对漫画、动画和网络极为熟悉和热衷的十一，配上对此一窍不通但温柔的包容着老公的佐村薰炭，会有怎样有趣的故事发生在这对夫妻之间呢？　　看似十分年轻但早已经嫁为人妻的树濑理乃（钉宫理惠 配音）、理乃的老公，职业拳击手树濑旺（坂井俊文 配音）、沉着冷静的小镇医生田中（新谷良子 配音）、田中的老公山田（外崎大辅 配音），在佐村薰炭和十一的周围，围绕着的是性格各异但都同样善良有趣的好友们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:05:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/guanyuwanquantingbudonglaogongzaishuoshimedeshidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.c